  "goodToKnow": "Traumhaft means wonderful, gorgeous or dreamlike: traumhaftes Wetter, ein traumhafter Strand, traumhaft schön. It's a favourite of travel brochures and estate agents. Der Traum is a dream: der Traumjob, das Traumhaus, Traumfrau. Träumen means to dream, and Träum weiter! (dream on!) is ironic. Don't confuse it with das Trauma (trauma)."
